What will the following code output?

```js
const myMap = new Map();
myMap.set('a', 1);
myMap.set('a', 2);
console.log(myMap.get('a'));
```

What will be the output of the following code?

```js
const set = new Set([1, 2, 3]);
set.delete(2);
console.log(set.has(2));
```

What will be the output of the following code?

```js
const map = new Map([["a", 1], ["b", 2]]);
map.clear();
console.log(map.size);
```
